n prose.", "failure_update_rule": "If the spread came out below 0.5 kcal/mol the level choice would not be decision-relevant, the SVP-protocol value could be delivered inside the task's own tolerance, and I would withdraw the tolerance refusal and re-claim ddg-activation-regio-353k with that smaller spread as its measured uncertainty."}]

